  |
  v
Command Line Interface
  |
  v
Transaction Processing
  |
  +----------------------+
  |                      |
  v                      v
Transaction Operations   Financial Analysis
  |                      |
  +----------+-----------+
             |
             v
        JSON Storage
        (data.json)
